{"seq":3,"slug":"empty-space-weight-reduction-limit","title":"空隙率与减重上限的合规测算与验证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/packaging-regulation-ppwr-sustainability/packaging-design-recyclability/empty-space-weight-reduction-limit","wordCount":2938,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"空隙率与减重上限的合规测算与验证\">空隙率与减重上限的合规测算与验证</h1><p>同样是装 12 支 250 ml 洗发水的纸箱，A 供应商用 400×300×250 mm 的内径，B 用 600×400×400 mm。前者空隙比约 72%，后者约 88%——在 2030 年 1 月 1 日之后两个都不合规，因为 PPWR 第 10 条给分组包装、运输包装与电商包装划了一条硬线：<strong>空隙比不得超过 50%</strong>。这条线把一个原本属于仓储工艺的参数，变成了写进技术文档、可被市场监管抽查、并可能引发平台附加费或下架的合规指标。本文讲清三件事：这条线究竟管哪些包装、附件 IV 的测算口径怎样落地成可复算的数、以及&quot;减重&quot;在法规里为什么根本没有上限数字。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-范围边界-管的是二三次包装与电商包装-不是销售包装\">核心概念：范围边界——管的是二三次包装与电商包装，不是销售包装</h2><p>第 10 条的空隙比门槛并不落在所有包装上，它点名三类：<strong>分组包装</strong>（grouped packaging）、<strong>运输包装</strong>（transport packaging）与<strong>电商包装</strong>（e-commerce packaging）。一件直接陈列在货架上的销售包装——哪怕它明显&quot;大盒装小件&quot;——不在 50% 的直接射程内；它受的是第 10 条第一款的&quot;最小化&quot;总则与&quot;不得设计成夸大内容物体积&quot;的约束，而非可量化的数字上限。</p>\n<p>跨境电商最容易出错的是<strong>电商包装的定义</strong>。PPWR 第 3 条把它定义为通过电商渠道配送商品所使用的包装，销售包装性质的与运输包装性质的都算。于是边界落成三条：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>消费者在网上下单、由你从海外仓发出的外箱与快递袋 = 电商包装，<strong>受 50% 约束</strong>；</li>\n<li>同一商品发给线下零售商、由零售商上架的外箱 = 运输/分组包装，<strong>同样受约束</strong>；</li>\n<li>货架上单独售卖的彩盒 = 销售包装，<strong>不受 50% 数字约束</strong>，但仍须满足最小化总则。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一个常被忽略的边界：当电商包装同时也是销售包装时（例如原包装直发，商品的外箱就是零售包装），它仍落入电商包装定义，仍受 50% 约束——不能因为&quot;它也是销售包装&quot;就豁免。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>包装层次</th>\n<th>PPWR 术语</th>\n<th>50% 空隙比上限</th>\n<th>主要并行约束</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一次/销售包装</td>\n<td>sales packaging</td>\n<td>不适用（仅最小化总则）</td>\n<td>第 6 条可回收性、第 7 条再生含量、第 12 条标识</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二次/分组包装</td>\n<td>grouped packaging</td>\n<td><strong>适用</strong>（2030-01-01 起）</td>\n<td>第 29 条复用目标 10% → 40%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三次/运输包装</td>\n<td>transport packaging</td>\n<td><strong>适用</strong></td>\n<td>第 29 条复用目标 40% → 70%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电商包装</td>\n<td>e-commerce packaging</td>\n<td><strong>适用</strong></td>\n<td>第 29 条复用目标 10% → 50%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可复用包装</td>\n<td>reusable packaging</td>\n<td>适用性须按条款与实施法案核对</td>\n<td>第 29 条、第 11 条</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>来源：Regulation (EU) 2025/40 第 3 条、第 10 条、第 29 条（OJ L, 22.1.2025）。可复用包装是否豁免空隙比上限属于须在委员会实施法案或指南明确后复核的细节，<strong>不应默认豁免</strong>。</p>\n<p>另需分清管辖轴：空隙比是&quot;产品要求&quot;（成分轴），EPR 登记与缴费是&quot;资源流轴&quot;。一个箱子可以空隙比合规却在德国 VerpackG 下漏登记 LUCID，两件事互不代替，详见同 hub <a href=\"../packaging-regulation-framework/multi-jurisdiction-overlap-conflict\">多法域法规叠加与冲突优先级处理</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"附件-iv-的测算口径-把-空隙-定义成可复算的数\">附件 IV 的测算口径：把&quot;空隙&quot;定义成可复算的数</h2><p>法规把计算方法单独放进附件 IV（空隙比测算方法），而不是留给各国自定，核心是一个比值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mtext>void</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>pkg</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>goods</mtext></msub></mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>pkg</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta_{\\text{void}} = \\frac{V_{\\text{pkg}} - V_{\\text{goods}}}{V_{\\text{pkg}}} \\times 100\\% \\le 50\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">void</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pkg</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pkg</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">goods</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.886em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>pkg</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{pkg}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pkg</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是包装可容纳内容物的内部容积，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>goods</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{goods}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">goods</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是内容物体积。三个口径分歧点必须写进技术文档并留证：</p>\n<p><strong>一是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mtext>pkg</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V\\_{\\text{pkg}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pkg</span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 取内径而非外径。</strong> 用外箱外形尺寸会把壁厚、摇盖与结构凸起错误计入，使结果偏松。瓦楞纸箱应按内径（ID）标注尺寸，即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>pkg</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>in</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>in</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>in</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{pkg}} = L_{\\text{in}} \\cdot W_{\\text{in}} \\cdot H_{\\text{in}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pkg</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>二是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mtext>goods</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V\\_{\\text{goods}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">goods</span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 对不规则商品怎么算。</strong> 圆柱瓶、软体玩具、异形件的&quot;体积&quot;有两种口径：真实体积（排水法或三维扫描测得）与外接长方体体积（bounding box）。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>goods</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{goods}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">goods</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 越大约束越松，口径选择直接决定合规结论。稳妥做法是双层测算——外接长方体为上限口径、真实体积为下限口径，两者都写进技术文档；若下限口径已满足 50%，结论即无争议。</p>\n<p><strong>三是填充物（dunnage）的处理。</strong> 空隙比衡量的是包装内部未被内容物占据的空间，因此用气泡膜、气枕&quot;填满&quot;箱子通常不改变空隙比的定义值——填充物本身是包装的一部分，它占据的正是&quot;空隙&quot;，而不是把商品变大。合规路径是把箱子做小，而不是往大箱子里塞填充物，两者成本差异巨大。</p>\n<p>对分组/运输包装，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>goods</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{goods}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">goods</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 通常是内装销售包装的总容积（含其排布），于是<strong>排布优化</strong>直接进入公式：同样数量的瓶装产品，交错排列能显著压低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>pkg</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{pkg}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pkg</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[选定 SKU 与包装层次] --&gt; B{是否分组 运输 或 电商包装}&#10;  B --&gt;|否| Z[记录不适用结论&lt;br/&gt;按最小化总则自查]&#10;  B --&gt;|是| C[测包装内径 L W H&lt;br/&gt;V_pkg = L*W*H]&#10;  C --&gt; D[测内容物体积 V_goods&lt;br/&gt;外接长方体 与 真实体积 双口径]&#10;  D --&gt; E[计算 V_pkg 减 V_goods 除以 V_pkg]&#10;  E --&gt; F{结果 小于等于 50%}&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[留证并入技术文档]&#10;  F --&gt;|否| H[设计改版&lt;br/&gt;缩小箱体 或 改排布]&#10;  H --&gt; C\">flowchart TD\n  A[选定 SKU 与包装层次] --&gt; B{是否分组 运输 或 电商包装}\n  B --&gt;|否| Z[记录不适用结论&lt;br/&gt;按最小化总则自查]\n  B --&gt;|是| C[测包装内径 L W H&lt;br/&gt;V_pkg = L*W*H]\n  C --&gt; D[测内容物体积 V_goods&lt;br/&gt;外接长方体 与 真实体积 双口径]\n  D --&gt; E[计算 V_pkg 减 V_goods 除以 V_pkg]\n  E --&gt; F{结果 小于等于 50%}\n  F --&gt;|是| G[留证并入技术文档]\n  F --&gt;|否| H[设计改版&lt;br/&gt;缩小箱体 或 改排布]\n  H --&gt; C</pre><h2 id=\"减重没有-上限数字-只有四条互相拉扯的约束\">减重没有&quot;上限数字&quot;，只有四条互相拉扯的约束</h2><p>标题里的&quot;减重上限&quot;需要先纠正一个误解：PPWR <strong>没有</strong>给出&quot;包装不得超过多少克&quot;的数值上限。第 10 条对重量与体积的要求是定性的——减至确保功能所必需的最小程度，且法规明确允许为满足其他要求而增加重量或体积。因此实践中的&quot;减重上限&quot;不是法规线，而是四条约束共同确定的最优点：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>功能与保护</strong>（第 10 条本身）：减重不能牺牲对商品的保护，易碎、冷链、危险品尤为敏感；</li>\n<li><strong>可回收性</strong>（第 6 条与附件 II）：减薄壁厚可能让材料跌破分选与再生工艺的接受区间，等级不升反降；</li>\n<li><strong>再生含量</strong>（第 7 条）：再生料常伴随力学性能与加工窗口变化，为达到同等保护可能需补偿性增重；</li>\n<li><strong>复用周转</strong>（第 29 条）：可复用包装须按循环次数设计强度，减重下限由周转强度决定。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>四条约束使减重成为一个带可行域的最优化问题，而非单向指标。这也解释了立法者为何不设重量数字：重量与体积的最优解高度依赖品类，法规只用 50% 空隙比这一个通用量化指标去兜底。工程上的正确问法不是&quot;还能减几克&quot;，而是&quot;在保护、可回收、复用三条约束不破的前提下，空隙比能否收敛到 50% 以内&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dim-weight-与托盘网格-减重的商业边界\">DIM weight 与托盘网格：减重的商业边界</h2><p>即便法规没有重量上限，承运人的<strong>体积重</strong>（dimensional weight）会给出实际的商业上限。快递计费取实重与体积重的较大值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>dim</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><mi>D</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{\\text{dim}} = \\frac{L \\times W \\times H}{D}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dim</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 为体积重系数（divisor），国际快递常用 139 in³/lb（约合 5000 cm³/kg）。箱子每多一立方厘米，计费重量就线性上升，即便商品重量不变。把空隙比从 88% 压到 50% 以内，往往同时把体积重降一到两档——<strong>合规与降本在此同向</strong>，这是减重最强的内部驱动力。</p>\n<p>托盘层面，EUR 托盘（1200×800 mm）的模数决定每层能放多少箱。箱体长宽若不是托盘模数的约数或倍数，边缘会留下无法利用的托盘级空隙；它不计入 PPWR 的空隙比（公式针对单件包装容积），却直接抬高运费与碳排。因此&quot;箱子做小&quot;应同时满足两条：单箱空隙比 ≤ 50%，且箱体尺寸落在托盘模数网格上。</p>\n<p>平台政策是这条边界的另一具象。亚马逊的&quot;原包装发货&quot;（Ships in Product Packaging, SIOC）与&quot;无障碍包装&quot;（Frustration-Free Packaging）计划以减小包装体积为导向，不达标会触发附加处理费。平台政策常严于法规，这正是产品要求与合同约束的叠加——取最严者。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>计费/合规维度</th>\n<th>依据</th>\n<th>数值或规则</th>\n<th>与空隙比的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>体积重</td>\n<td>承运人（UPS / FedEx / IATA 口径）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>139</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L \\times W \\times H / 139</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord\">/139</span></span></span></span></span>（in³/lb）或 /5000（cm³/kg）</td>\n<td>空隙比下降 → 体积重下降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>托盘模数</td>\n<td>EUR 托盘 1200×800 mm</td>\n<td>箱体长宽取模数的约数或倍数</td>\n<td>减少托盘级空隙</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台包装政策</td>\n<td>Amazon SIOC / FFP 等</td>\n<td>体积与性能门槛，违反等于附加费或下架</td>\n<td>常严于 50% 法规线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复用周转</td>\n<td>PPWR 第 29 条</td>\n<td>电商包装复用 10%（2030）→ 50%（2040）</td>\n<td>复用箱须按周转强度设计</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"验证与举证-技术文档-测量口径与自查\">验证与举证：技术文档、测量口径与自查</h2><p>合规不是&quot;算过就行&quot;，而是&quot;能向市场监管复算、能留存证据&quot;。PPWR 的合规定档走<strong>技术文档</strong>路径：生产者须为每一件包装建立技术文档，包含设计图纸、材料清单、所适用标准、测试报告与空隙比测算过程，并在产品投放市场后按规定年限保存。市场监管机构可要求调阅，平台在争议时也会索取。因此测算必须满足三个可核查条件：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>可复现</strong>：记录所用尺寸（内径）、内容物口径（外接长方体/真实体积）、公式与结果，使第三方以同样输入得到同样输出；</li>\n<li><strong>有边界声明</strong>：写明所依据的法规版本与附件口径，并说明在委员会实施法案更新测算方法后本测算的适用性——口径应做成可配置项而非硬编码；</li>\n<li><strong>有不确定性处理</strong>：手工测量存在线性尺寸误差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>，其对体积的相对误差近似为</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><mi>V</mi></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><mi>L</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><mi>W</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><mi>H</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\Delta V}{V} \\approx \\frac{\\Delta L}{L} + \\frac{\\Delta W}{W} + \\frac{\\Delta H}{H}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>尺寸越小，相对误差越敏感；对贴近 50% 边界的 SKU，应留安全余量并记录测量方法（卷尺、激光或三维扫描）。</p>\n<p>打样前的自查顺序：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>判定该 SKU 的包装层次，确认是否落在分组、运输、电商三类内；</li>\n<li>用内径算出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>pkg</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{pkg}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pkg</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，用双口径算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>goods</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{goods}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">goods</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，得出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mtext>void</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta_{\\text{void}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">void</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；</li>\n<li>若超出 50%，先做结构或排布改版，而非加填充物；</li>\n<li>检查减重是否触发第 6、7 条的可回收性与再生含量反噬，参见同章 <a href=\"recyclability-grading-design-criteria\">可回收性分级标准与设计准则</a>；</li>\n<li>复核托盘模数与体积重，使合规与降本同向；</li>\n<li>把测算过程与结论写入技术文档并留档，作为向监管、EPR 机构与平台举证的底稿。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>空隙率是 PPWR 里少数几个可被精确复算的数字，它把包装设计从经验判断拉进工程计算；而&quot;减重上限&quot;在法规中并不存在，它由功能保护、可回收性、再生含量、复用周转四条约束，加上体积重与托盘模数的商业边界共同决定。对跨境卖家最实际的行动顺序是：先建立每个 SKU 的包装层次与内径尺寸主数据，再把空隙比测算固化成可复算的技术文档条目，最后用托盘模数与体积重校验改版方向。2030 年 1 月 1 日之前，这三步完成得越早，设计改版的代价越低。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"空隙率与减重上限的合规测算与验证","id":"空隙率与减重上限的合规测算与验证"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：范围边界——管的是二三次包装与电商包装，不是销售包装","id":"核心概念-范围边界-管的是二三次包装与电商包装-不是销售包装"},{"level":2,"text":"附件 IV 的测算口径：把\"空隙\"定义成可复算的数","id":"附件-iv-的测算口径-把-空隙-定义成可复算的数"},{"level":2,"text":"减重没有\"上限数字\"，只有四条互相拉扯的约束","id":"减重没有-上限数字-只有四条互相拉扯的约束"},{"level":2,"text":"DIM weight 与托盘网格：减重的商业边界","id":"dim-weight-与托盘网格-减重的商业边界"},{"level":2,"text":"验证与举证：技术文档、测量口径与自查","id":"验证与举证-技术文档-测量口径与自查"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"面向回收的设计（DfR）材料与结构规范","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/packaging-regulation-ppwr-sustainability/packaging-design-recyclability/design-for-recycling-material-spec"},"next":{"title":"EPR 注册与包装登记号生命周期管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/packaging-regulation-ppwr-sustainability/packaging-epr-registration/epr-registration-identifier-lifecycle"}}